"promised","escape","complexities","real","world"],"ch":9},{"t":68.55,"dur":7.28,"clip":"09_arcade-era/AI_historical_reconstruction_VHS…_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/AI_historical_reconstruction_VHS…_202607101900.mp4","in":0,"text":"They promised they escaped from reality, but they were trapped in a private world.","kw":["promised","escaped","reality","trapped","private","world"],"ch":9},{"t":77.03,"dur":3,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Man_operating_complex_machine_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Man_operating_complex_machine_202607101900.mp4","in":6.88,"text":"leaving us alone in a private world.","kw":["leaving","alone","private","world"],"ch":9},{"t":84.63,"dur":4,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Teenager's_face_emerging_VR_headset_202607101939.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Teenager's_face_emerging_VR_headset_202607101939.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"A world where we could escape the confines of our own bodies.","kw":["world","where","could","escape","confines","bodies"],"ch":9},{"t":90.31,"dur":5,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Arcade_players_laugh_and_shout_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Arcade_players_laugh_and_shout_202607101900.mp4","in":0,"text":"Whoa, where'd he go? Turn to your right! He is right behind you!","kw":["whoa","where","turn","your","right","behind"],"ch":9},{"t":96.94,"dur":6,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Crowded_mall_with_VR_pods_202607101939.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Crowded_mall_with_VR_pods_202607101939.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"But behind the promise of new worlds lay a strange new kind of isolation.","kw":["behind","promise","worlds","strange","kind","isolation"],"ch":9},{"t":104.17,"dur":5,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Shopping_mall_atrium_at_night_202607101939.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Shopping_mall_atrium_at_night_202607101939.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"But the virtual worlds were just reflections of our own emptiness.","kw":["virtual","worlds","just","reflections","emptiness"],"ch":9},{"t":110.74,"dur":3.76,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Person_in_VR_headset_holds_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Person_in_VR_headset_holds_202607101900.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1991, virtual reality arrived.","kw":["virtual","reality","arrived"],"ch":9},{"t":118.69,"dur":2.28,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","in":2.02,"text":"Virtual reality is finally here.","kw":["virtual","reality","finally","here"],"ch":9},{"t":123.39,"dur":3.36,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Person_in_VR_headset_holds_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Person_in_VR_headset_holds_202607101900.mp4","in":3.64,"text":"It promised an escape from banal reality.","kw":["promised","escape","banal","reality"],"ch":9},{"t":129.23,"dur":3,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Man_operating_complex_machine_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Man_operating_complex_machine_202607101900.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1991, we were promised a new escape.","kw":["promised","escape"],"ch":9},{"t":135.93,"dur":4,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Crowded_mall_with_VR_pods_202607101939.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Crowded_mall_with_VR_pods_202607101939.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1991, a new kind of escape arrived.","kw":["kind","escape","arrived"],"ch":9}],"duck":[[0,10.01,0.55],[13.43,23.58,0.28],[25.71,32.96,0.28],[38.02,46.91,0.28],[50.41,55.66,0.28],[61.36,66.61,0.28],[68.55,76.08,0.28],[77.03,80.28,0.28],[84.63,88.88,0.28],[90.31,95.56,0.28],[96.94,103.19,0.28],[104.17,109.42,0.28],[110.74,114.75,0.28],[118.69,121.22,0.28],[123.39,127,0.28],[129.23,132.48,0.28],[135.93,140.18,0.28]],"coverage":0.805,"used":33,"pool":41,"speech":0.572,"eras":[9],"filmName":"SWEEP 9 FILM ch9"}